  "qualification": "Post-hoc exploratory shape check. Fits only .75\u20132.4um in each recovery-era season; MIR already seen before model calculation, so retrospective prediction check. Rectangular CWAVE/CBAND responses, coarse CK04 grid (3500\u20136500K/logg2\u20133/metal\u22121\u20130), Draine static foreground attenuation and free normalization. Equal log-flux weights; grid score is not likelihood. Parameter degeneracy, correlated calibration, missing actual response curves and atmosphere errors prevent precision temperatures or excess limits. Local and native methods share science pixels; their agreement is methodological, not independent astrophysical replication."
